# Ask the agent (docs/design/06-agent.md §11): explain an incident, or answer a question about the
# last minutes. Served by the agent's node (/jarvis/agent/analyze); the gateway's /agent/ask calls
# it. Feedback says what the agent is doing; the result is the insight, which the agent also
# publishes as an INSIGHT event like any other.
string incident_id       # explain this incident; empty: a question about the recent events
string question          # what to answer (optional with an incident)
string requester         # who asked, for the audit trail
---
bool success
string message           # why not, when success is false (no such incident, the agent is busy)
string insight_json      # jarvis.insight/v1
---
string stage             # window · triage · model · tool · checks · proposals · done
string detail
